---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ContactForm from '../components/ContactForm';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Contact accompagnement pierre précieuse"
  description="Présentez votre projet d'achat de pierre précieuse (budget, type, critères). Réponse sous 48h. Accompagnement indépendant, sans vente ni pression."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative py-28 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 gradient-warm"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-20 left-20 w-72 h-72 bg-copper-200/20 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="relative max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="max-w-3xl" data-animate>
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-copper-100 rounded-full text-copper-700 text-sm font-medium mb-6">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 12h.01M12 12h.01M16 12h.01M21 12c0 4.418-4.03 8-9 8a9.863 9.863 0 01-4.255-.949L3 20l1.395-3.72C3.512 15.042 3 13.574 3 12c0-4.418 4.03-8 9-8s9 3.582 9 8z" />
          </svg>
          Contact
        </div>
        <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl text-warm-900 font-medium leading-tight">
          Présenter mon projet
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-8 text-xl text-warm-800 leading-relaxed">
          Décrivez votre projet et recevez une première réponse sous 48h.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-6 text-warm-800 leading-relaxed text-base">
          Pour que je puisse vous répondre utilement, indiquez si possible : le type de pierre (ou l'usage final), une fourchette de budget, vos préférences sur les traitements, et votre horizon de temps. Je travaille sur des projets sérieux d'acquisition, y compris lorsqu'il faut analyser une annonce ou un certificat avant de décider. Si votre demande est viable, je vous propose un échange court pour cadrer la suite.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Form Section -->
  <section class="py-28 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-3 gap-12">
        <!-- Form -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-2" data-animate>
          <div class="bg-sand p-8 md:p-10 rounded-3xl">
            <ContactForm client:idle />
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Sidebar -->
        <div class="space-y-6" data-animate style="transition-delay: 0.1s;">
          <div class="card-warm p-6 bg-warm-50 rounded-2xl">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-copper-100 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-copper-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-medium text-warm-900">Comment ça fonctionne</h3>
            </div>
            <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm text-warm-800">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center bg-copper-100 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium text-copper-700 flex-shrink-0">1</span>
                <span class="pt-0.5">Vous décrivez votre projet via ce formulaire</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center bg-copper-100 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium text-copper-700 flex-shrink-0">2</span>
                <span class="pt-0.5">Je vous réponds sous 48h avec une première évaluation</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center bg-copper-100 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium text-copper-700 flex-shrink-0">3</span>
                <span class="pt-0.5">Si le projet est viable, nous échangeons pour affiner le cadre</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="card-warm p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-warm-800 to-warm-900 text-cream rounded-2xl">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-copper-500/20 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-copper-300" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-medium">Rappel des honoraires</h3>
            </div>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-warm-300">
              <li class="flex justify-between">
                <span>Acompte de mission</span>
                <span class="text-copper-300 font-medium">500 €</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex justify-between">
                <span>Commission</span>
                <span class="text-copper-300 font-medium">6-8 %</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
            <a href="/honoraires" class="group mt-5 inline-flex items-center text-sm text-copper-300 hover:text-copper-200 transition-colors duration-300">
              Voir les détails
              <svg class="ml-1 w-3 h-3 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="card-warm p-6 bg-warm-50 rounded-2xl border border-warm-100">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-warm-200 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-warm-800" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-medium text-warm-900">Pas adapté pour</h3>
            </div>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-warm-800">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-warm-200 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                  <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-warm-800" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12" />
                  </svg>
                </span>
                <span>Demandes urgentes</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-warm-200 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                  <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-warm-800" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12" />
                  </svg>
                </span>
                <span>Demande de validation gratuite</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-warm-200 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                  <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-warm-800" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12" />
                  </svg>
                </span>
                <span>Recherche du prix le plus bas</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-warm-200 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                  <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-warm-800" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12" />
                  </svg>
                </span>
                <span>Budgets inférieurs à 5 000 €</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-warm-700 italic">
              Discrétion : vos informations ne sont utilisées que pour répondre à votre demande.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Liens internes -->
          <div class="text-sm space-y-2">
            <a href="/services" class="flex items-center gap-2 text-warm-800 hover:text-copper-600 transition-colors">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
              </svg>
              Voir : toutes les aides
            </a>
            <a href="/comment-je-travaille" class="flex items-center gap-2 text-warm-800 hover:text-copper-600 transition-colors">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
              </svg>
              Voir : comment je travaille
            </a>
            <a href="/provenance-ethique" class="flex items-center gap-2 text-warm-800 hover:text-copper-600 transition-colors">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
              </svg>
              Voir : provenance & éthique
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
